// Tuplet Test - Demonstrates bracket direction based on stem direction
// LILYPOND-REF: lily/tuplet-bracket.cc:560-630 get_default_dir
time 4/4
key c major

// High notes (stem down) - bracket should go below
// 3/2 triplet = 2 beats, + 2 quarter notes = 4 beats total
tuplet 3/2 { c4 d e } f4 g4 |

// Low notes (stem up) - bracket should go above  
tuplet 3/2 { c4 d e } f4 g4 |

// Mixed notes - majority decides
tuplet 3/2 { c4 d e } f4 g4 |
